<div class="bard-content bard-box light-grey">
    
    <p><strong>Age Recommendation</strong>: Please check back nearer the time.</p><p>Everyone, regardless of age, must have their own ticket to enter the theatre. Children under the age of 16 must be accompanied by, and seated next to, a ticketholder who is at least 18 years old. Children under the age of 3 will not be admitted.</p>
    
